# k.wearables/shards/words: the English words of k.wearables (its types, keys and values), stored beside the world (owner's
# decision 2026-11-15 08:10); tools/build-catalog.mjs reads them as the world's own words.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository; the block at the end by tools/key-words.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written); the block of word wires for keys: tools/key-words.mjs

# Words for the types and keys of this world.
@k.wearables.word.wearable core.word text=wear text=wears text=wearing text=worn text=clothes text=clothing text=garment text=garments means=k.wearables.wearable core.source="hand-core 1"
@k.wearables.word.worn_on core.word text=where text=on means=k.wearables.wearable.worn_on core.source="hand-core 1"

# Words for the keys, by rule: the name of each key, and everyday words for some (tools/key-words.mjs).
